const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"订单簿事件不只是成交",en:"Order book events extend beyond trades"},body:{zh:"论文从最优买卖报价及其挂单数量出发，把市价成交、限价单新增和撤单共同纳入供需变化。成交量只记录已经撮合的部分，无法描述尚未成交的流动性变化。因此只有价格柱和成交量时，不能直接声称重建了论文的订单流不平衡。",en:"The paper starts from best bid and ask prices and displayed sizes, combining market trades, limit-order additions and cancellations. Traded volume records only matched activity, not all changes in available liquidity. Price bars and volume alone therefore cannot establish that the paper's order flow imbalance has been reconstructed."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第1–4页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 1–4"}}},{title:{zh:"OFI是按事件累计的净变化",en:"OFI aggregates signed event contributions"},body:{zh:"订单流不平衡按最优报价及队列变化，为每个事件赋予带方向的贡献，再在时间窗内累计。买方队列增加与卖方队列增加的方向不同，最优价格改变时也要按定义处理。它不是简单用买入成交量减去卖出成交量，更不是整本订单簿的静态买卖数量差。",en:"Order flow imbalance aggregates signed contributions from changes in best prices and queues over an interval. Added bid and ask size contribute in opposite directions, and best-price changes need their own treatment. OFI is neither simply buyer volume minus seller volume nor a static difference across the entire order book."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第4–5页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 4–5"}}},{title:{zh:"相同不平衡在不同深度下含义不同",en:"Depth changes the response to imbalance"},body:{zh:"作者把时间窗内以最小价格变动单位计量的中点变化，与同窗OFI联系起来，并讨论斜率随市场深度下降而增大的关系。价格单位、挂单数量单位和深度定义必须同时明确；这个简化关系并不保证任意市场、任意规模的订单都有相同线性影响。",en:"The model relates midpoint changes measured in ticks to OFI over the same interval and links a larger slope to lower market depth. Price units, size units and the depth definition must travel together. This simplified relation does not guarantee linear impact for every order size or market."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第5–8页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 5–8"}}},{title:{zh:"时间窗是研究设定的一部分",en:"The observation window is part of the design"},body:{zh:"作者稿使用2010年4月随机选取的50只标普500股票，基准观察网格为10秒，并在半小时区间估计关系。论文还考察其他时间尺度。更换股票范围、市场时段或聚合窗口会改变样本与参数，不能把原文的短窗结论直接移到日频数据。",en:"The draft studies 50 randomly selected S&P 500 stocks in April 2010, using a ten-second baseline grid and estimating relations within half-hour periods. Other timescales are also examined. Changing the universe, session or aggregation window changes the sample and parameters; short-window findings cannot simply be transferred to daily data."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第8–11页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 8–11"}}},{title:{zh:"同期解释不是下一刻的预测",en:"Contemporaneous fit is not a forecast"},body:{zh:"核心比较使用同一窗口里的价格变化和订单流不平衡，是同期解释关系，而不是提前知道下一窗口的价格。部分事件还同时改变最优报价，存在机械联系需要检查。若研究预测能力，必须另设信息截止点与未来目标，不能把同期拟合优度当成预测成绩。",en:"The core comparison is contemporaneous: price changes and OFI come from the same interval, not a forecast of the next interval. Some events also change best prices, requiring checks for mechanical association. Predictive evaluation needs a separate information cutoff and future target rather than reusing contemporaneous fit as a forecasting score."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第8–11页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 8–11"}}},{title:{zh:"保留报价事件与清洗依据",en:"Retain event records and filtering choices"},body:{zh:"附录说明了报价、成交记录的筛选、交易时段和最优报价整理。准备新数据时，应保留事件时间、买卖价格与数量、记录类型和过滤原因，并核对是否具备合并最优报价所需信息。只有这些边界清楚，才能判断指标缺口来自市场行为还是数据覆盖。",en:"The appendix describes quote and trade filtering, sessions and construction of best quotes. For new data, retain event times, bid and ask prices and sizes, record types and exclusion reasons, checking whether consolidated best-quote information is available. These boundaries distinguish economic variation from gaps in data coverage."},reference:{url:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1011.6402v3",label:{zh:"原文定位：2011年3月作者稿v3，第4, 26页",en:"Source: March 2011 author draft v3, pp. 4, 26"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读采用2011年作者稿v3，题录保留2014年期刊版。最优报价处的同期关系不是未来价格预测，也不代表完整订单簿或真实执行成本；分钟成交量不足以替代所需输入。",en:"This guide uses the 2011 author draft v3 while retaining the 2014 journal citation. Best-quote contemporaneous relationships are not forecasts, a complete order book or execution costs; minute-level traded volume cannot replace the required inputs."}};export{e as default};
